{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/postgresql' data-target='computer\/program\/postgresql' data-title='PostgreSQL'>\r\n\t\t\tPostgreSQL\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Commands: Quit, Import, db, tables, Relations, and Insert {\\n}.","label":"Commands","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/postgresql\/design","label":"Design","url":"\/computer\/program\/postgresql\/design"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>Quit<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\\q.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Login                -U &lt;user&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Password        -P &lt;password&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Connect to db        \\c &lt;db&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>use &lt;db_name&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Import<\/h2>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Create Table.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>2. \\copy &lt;Table_Name&gt; from &lt;path&gt; Delimiter \u2018&lt;delimiter-char&gt;\u2019 [CSV] [Header]<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tConsole.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNull \\N or.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>NULL as &lt;\u2018null string\u2019&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFor example, csv WITH NULL AS 'null'.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Export                \\copy (SQL_Query) to &lt;path&gt; delimiter \u2018&lt;delimiter-char&gt;\u2019<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tList.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>db<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\\list.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>tables<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\\dt.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Relations<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\\d.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Insert {\\n}<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tE\u2019ABC\\nXYZ\u2019.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Create DB        Create database &lt;name&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Describe        \\d+ &lt;table-name&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSelect column_name from INFORMATION_SCHEMA.COLUMNS where table_name = 'table';.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Index<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCreates index on Auth_RoleRules (Role);.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMust be standalone statement.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Truncate        truncate &lt;table&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Drop<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Drop dropdb &lt;DB-NAME&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDrop all.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDrop schema public cascade;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCreates schema public;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Dump database<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Dump database pg_dump -h&lt;IP&gt; -U&lt;User&gt; &lt;DB&gt; &gt; &lt;Path&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Push database<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Push database psql &lt;DB&gt; &lt; &lt;Path&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Push database psql -f &lt;Path&gt; &lt;User&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Push database \\i &lt;Path&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Password change<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Password change alter user &lt;user&gt; UNENCRYPTED password '&lt;password&gt;';<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Add user<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Add user Create role &lt;name&gt; WITH PASSWORD '&lt;password&gt;\u2019<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tINHERIT attribute - for Role and Users (like the SQL standard).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttp:\/\/www.postgresql.org\/docs\/8.1\/static\/sql-createrole.html\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Set Null<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Set Null set &lt;Column&gt; = NULL<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Delete duplicates<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Delete duplicates DELETE FROM &lt;Table&gt; WHERE ctid NOT IN<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Delete duplicates (SELECT max(ctid) FROM &lt;Table&gt;  GROUP BY &lt;Table&gt;.*) ;<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/postgresql\/commands\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/postgresql\/commands\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/postgresql\/design' data-target='computer\/program\/postgresql\/design' data-title='Design' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Design<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/program\/postgresql' data-tar